  "cil_liability": false,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed extensions, by reason of their excessive scale, lack of subordination, inadequate setback from the principal elevation, proximity to the side boundary, and unsympathetic roof design, would appear as dominant and incongruous additions that fail to respect the proportions and architectural character of the host dwelling. The introduction of a dual-pitched roof and side gable would be out of keeping with both the host property and the prevailing hipped roof form of the surrounding area. Combined with the substantial extensions already undertaken, the proposal would result in an overdeveloped form of development that would harm the character and appearance of the host dwelling and the surrounding area. The proposal therefore conflicts with Policies CC1, CC2 and SC7 of the adopted Local Plan and the guidance set out in the Residential Extensions Guidelines."
  ]
